Guilds are broken into 4 distinct groups:

|YK0Neutral Aligned|WK0
    Bard        |  Psionicist     |  Fighter
    Swashbuckler|  

|YK0Aligned with |GKBGaea|WK0
    Garou       |  Lunar         |  Ninja

|YK0Aligned with |YKBMitra|WK0
    Cleric      |  Mage          |  Paladin

|YK0Aligned with |RK0Set|WK0
    Priest      | Thief


Those aligned with a diety may not join a guild aligned with another diety.
Neutrally aligned guilds may join any other guild, regardless of diety.

For example, a Lunar may not join the Cleric guild, but can join the
ranks of Bard or even Ninja.

